flowchart TD
    Q([User asks · scope = .general<br/>no app in front]) --> FRONT

    subgraph FRONT[General-Chat front-end · figure out the request]
      direction TB
      F1[Scope resolution<br/>which apps does this touch?]
      F2[Cross-app clarifier<br/>ask if operation/app is unclear]
      F3[Action resolution<br/>executable? routes across all sources]
      F4[Capability hub<br/>expose enabled apps' MCP + histories]
      F5[Local evidence<br/>what's actually on THIS Mac]
      F1 --> F2 --> F3 --> F4 --> F5
    end

    FRONT --> GATE{App needed but<br/>not granted?}
    GATE -->|yes| ENABLE[Enable app for this chat<br/>one-tap grant → re-ask]
    ENABLE --> FRONT
    GATE -->|no| ENG[Shared engine → see 08<br/>same AppScopedChatService.send]

    ENG --> GAP{Capability gap?<br/>right app, nothing can answer}
    GAP -->|yes| SAY[Say what IS possible · honest]
    GAP -->|no| ANS([Answer + receipts])
